\ mini-stack.8th -- Thinking 8th, Chapter 7
\ Verified with: 8th code/ch07/mini-stack.8th
\
\ A private, auxiliary stack of your own, built from an ordinary
\ mutable array: a:push adds to the top, a:pop removes from it. No
\ custom CREATE/ALLOT bookkeeping needed, the way Forth required.

[ ] var, mystack

mystack @ 1 a:push mystack !
mystack @ 2 a:push mystack !
mystack @ 3 a:push mystack !

mystack @ a:pop swap mystack ! . cr    \ => 3
mystack @ a:pop swap mystack ! . cr    \ => 2

bye
